{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented `refund_order` and `export_credit_note`. Each partial refund reverses the difference between cumulative tax owed back and tax already reversed. A full refund therefore reverses the order’s exact subtotal and tax, regardless of how it was split.\n\nRefunds and upgrades share ledger-wide idempotency keys. An identical retry returns the original entry, even after a full refund. Conflicting retries and over-refunds raise `ValidationError`. Credit notes export the recorded refund amounts as positive magnitudes and include the original reason.\n\nAdded five refund tests. `run_checks.py` exited 0 with all 18 tests passing."}}
